ons"},{"text":"Policy recommendations"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Develop Research & Policy Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start moving from simply understanding social issues to producing evidence."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Qualitative research"},{"text":"Quantitative research"},{"text":"Survey design"},{"text":"Interview techniques"},{"text":"Focus groups"},{"text":"Case-study methodology"},{"text":"Policy analysis"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Report writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"KoboToolbox/ODK"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Basic Python or R"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research project"},{"type":"note","label":"Project","text":"Community Rights Survey"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Access to Government Welfare Schemes Among Rural Youth”"},{"type":"p","text":"Collect a small ethical sample and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Awareness"},{"text":"Access"},{"text":"Barriers"},{"text":"Demographics"},{"text":"Satisfaction"},{"text":"Information gaps"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Report","Data Dashboard","Policy Brief"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This is much stronger for an advocacy portfolio than a certificate alone."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Build Advocacy Capability","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should begin developing professional advocacy skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"h","text":"Policy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy cycle"},{"text":"Policy formulation"},{"text":"Policy implementation"},{"text":"Regulatory analysis"},{"text":"Legislative processes"},{"text":"Government schemes"},{"text":"Public administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advocacy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stakeholder mapping"},{"text":"Power-interest analysis"},{"text":"Advocacy strategy"},{"text":"Campaign planning"},{"text":"Coalition building"},{"text":"Policy influencing"},{"text":"Public consultations"},{"text":"Media engagement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy brief writing"},{"text":"Position papers"},{"text":"Press releases"},{"text":"Op-eds"},{"text":"Executive summaries"},{"text":"Presentation decks"},{"text":"Public speaking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important tools"},{"type":"table","header":["Tool","Purpose"],"rows":[[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Research/data analysis"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Advocacy dashboards"}],[{"text":"KoboToolbox/ODK"},{"text":"Field surveys"}],[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"Geographic/social issue mapping"}],[{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Campaign materials"}],[{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Policy presentations"}],[{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Collaboration"}],[{"text":"Notion/Airtable"},{"text":"Stakeholder/project management"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Structured data analysis"}],[{"text":"Python/R"},{"text":"Advanced research analysis"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Become Employer Ready","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"If the BA is four years, use the final year to produce a professional advocacy portfolio."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Create 4–6 strong projects."},{"type":"table","header":["Project","Demonstrates"],"rows":[[{"text":"Human Rights Policy Brief"},{"text":"Policy research"}],[{"text":"Advocacy Campaign Plan"},{"text":"Advocacy strategy"}],[{"text":"Community Survey"},{"text":"Field research"}],[{"text":"Social Issue Dashboard"},{"text":"Data analytics"}],[{"text":"Stakeholder Mapping"},{"text":"Strategic thinking"}],[{"text":"Impact Assessment"},{"text":"Monitoring & evaluation"}],[{"text":"Human Rights Report"},{"text":"Research + writing"}],[{"text":"Public Awareness Campaign"},{"text":"Communication"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended capstone"},{"type":"h","text":"“Evidence-Based Advocacy Strategy for a Human Rights Issue”"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem definition"},{"text":"Evidence review"},{"text":"Stakeholder analysis"},{"text":"Power analysis"},{"text":"Policy environment"},{"text":"Advocacy objectives"},{"text":"Target decision-makers"},{"text":"Campaign strategy"},{"text":"Communication strategy"},{"text":"Coalition strategy"},{"text":"Monitoring indicators"},{"text":"Expected policy outcomes"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Primary Focus","Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Humanities + human rights foundation"},{"text":"1 research project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Research + data"},{"text":"Survey + policy brief"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Advocacy + policy"},{"text":"Advocacy campaign"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional specialisation"},{"text":"Portfolio + internship + capstone"}]]}]},{"heading":"Specialisations Within Advocacy","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should eventually choose a domain."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Human Rights Advocacy"},{"type":"p","text":"Work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Civil liberties"},{"text":"Child rights"},{"text":"Gender rights"},{"text":"Disability rights"},{"text":"Minority rights"},{"text":"Refugee rights"},{"text":"Digital rights"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Policy Advocacy"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Public-policy organisations"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Development organisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Humanitarian Advocacy"},{"type":"p","text":"Work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conflict"},{"text":"Displacement"},{"text":"Refugees"},{"text":"Disaster response"},{"text":"Humanitarian protecti